{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13540","headline":"泉上雨後作 · 元季川","name":"泉上雨後作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风雨荡繁暑，雷息佳霁初。\n衆峰带云雨，清气入我庐。\n飒飒凉飙来，临窥惬所图。\n绿萝长新蔓，褭褭垂坐隅。\n流水复檐下，丹砂发清渠。\n养葛爲我衣，种芋爲我蔬。\n谁是畹与畦，弥漫连野芜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元季川","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}